---
import { Github, Twitter } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="bio">
    <p>
        Hello! My name is <b>Orion</b>, and I am a self-taught developer who has been passionate about computing since I was a child. I started learning programming when I was 8 years old, and gradually acquired more knowledge and rigour in my work. I try my hand at many areas of IT, such as programming, cyber security and system administration, but I mainly stick to programming.
    </p>
    <p>
        I'm also just a high school student from Alsace, specialising in NSI (Computer Science) and Mathematics, with an optional course in Advanced Mathematics.
    </p>
    <div class="socials">
        <a href="https://github.com/oriionn" target="_blank">
            <Github />
        </a>
        <a href="https://x.com/orion_offi" target="_blank">
            <Twitter />
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    b {
        font-weight: 476;
    }

    p {
        margin-top: 0;
    }

    .socials {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 10px;
    }

    .socials a {
        background: var(--secondary-background);
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 5px;

        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
    }

    svg {
        stroke: var(--primary-foreground);
    }
</style>
